concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15gg-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15GG(4) ART Minister may nominate ART members"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15gg-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A nominated Tribunal member has, in relation to the performance or exercise of a function or power conferred on a nominated Tribunal member by this Act, the same protection and immunity as a Justice of the High Court has in relation to proceedings in the High Court.   Part IAB  Controlled operations" ;
    skos:definition "(4) A nominated Tribunal member has, in relation to the performance or exercise of a function or power conferred on a nominated Tribunal member by this Act, the same protection and immunity as a Justice of the High Court has in relation to proceedings in the High Court.   Part IAB  Controlled operations"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "34fa639b10574d02efd35fd5d2df23af2bc683cb2e149c94c23dc2dd5f462b7a" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15gg ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Protection and immunity for nominated Tribunal members" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
