concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15gh-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15GH(3) Applications for authorities to conduct controlled operations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15gh-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Nothing in this Part prevents an application for an authority being made in respect of a controlled operation that has been the subject of a previous application, but in that case the subsequent application must be a formal application. Note: An urgent authority can be varied, but not so as to extend its duration—see sections 15GO and 15GS." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Nothing in this Part prevents an application for an authority being made in respect of a controlled operation that has been the subject of a previous application, but in that case the subsequent application must be a formal application. Note: An urgent authority can be varied, but not so as to extend its duration—see sections 15GO and 15GS."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1985751e49f4fce997dbfe6a50c59b33d359af9a8e935bd167f7e138318475a6" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15gh ;
    cof:pageNumber "30"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Subsequent application for authority must be formal." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-act-1914.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.30" ;
