concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15he a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15HE Protection from criminal responsibility for certain ancillary"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15he ;
    values:originalText "conduct  (1) This section applies if:  (a) a person engages in conduct (the ancillary conduct) that relates to controlled conduct (the related controlled conduct) engaged in by another person; and  (b) engaging in the ancillary conduct is an ancillary offence in relation to the offence constituted by the related controlled conduct.  (2) Despite any other law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory, the person who engaged in the ancillary conduct is not criminally responsible for the ancillary offence if, at the time the person engaged in the ancillary conduct, he or she believed the related controlled conduct was being engaged in, or would be engaged in, by a participant in a controlled operation authorised under this Part.   Part IAB  Controlled operations" ;
    skos:definition "conduct  (1) This section applies if:  (a) a person engages in conduct (the ancillary conduct) that relates to controlled conduct (the related controlled conduct) engaged in by another person; and  (b) engaging in the ancillary conduct is an ancillary offence in relation to the offence constituted by the related controlled conduct.  (2) Despite any other law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory, the person who engaged in the ancillary conduct is not criminally responsible for the ancillary offence if, at the time the person engaged in the ancillary conduct, he or she believed the related controlled conduct was being engaged in, or would be engaged in, by a participant in a controlled operation authorised under this Part.   Part IAB  Controlled operations"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "85ca6d6d291c070dbcb28efa667bbed81c9c789b5bb515725a7bad753f6171ba" ;
    cof:pageNumber "55"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15he-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15he-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
