doc:sec-15ho-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "15HO(1) Annual report by Ombudsman" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Ombudsman must, as soon as practicable after 30 June in each year:  (a) prepare a report of the work and activities under this Part of the Ombudsman for the preceding 12 months; and  (b) give a copy of the report to the Minister and to the chief officer of the law enforcement agency to which the report relates.   Controlled operations  Part IAB Compliance and monitoring  Division 4  Section 15HP  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "70"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ho-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15HO(2) Annual report by Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15ho-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A report under this section must not include information which, if made public, could reasonably be expected to:  (a) endanger a person’s safety; or  (b) prejudice an investigation or prosecution; or  (c) compromise any law enforcement agency’s operational activities or methodologies." ;
    skos:definition "(2) A report under this section must not include information which, if made public, could reasonably be expected to:  (a) endanger a person’s safety; or  (b) prejudice an investigation or prosecution; or  (c) compromise any law enforcement agency’s operational activities or methodologies."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c308860914f11d01a83abb26e9011c332fdedea113ccaa970793d19292ea3468" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ho ;
    cof:pageNumber "70"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Report cannot include information that could endanger a person's safety, prejudice an investigation or prosecution, or compromise law enforcement activities." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
