concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ho-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15HO(4) Annual report by Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15ho-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A report must include, for each authorising agency concerned, comments on the comprehensiveness and adequacy of the reports which were provided to the Ombudsman by the chief officer of the authorising agency under sections 15HM and 15HN." ;
