concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hx a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15HX Delegation by Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15hx ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Ombudsman may, by written instrument, delegate to an APS employee responsible to the Ombudsman all or any of the Ombudsman’s powers under this Division, other than a power to report to the Minister.   Controlled operations  Part IAB Compliance and monitoring  Division 4  Section 15HY  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) A delegate must, upon request by a person affected by the exercise of any power delegated to the delegate, produce the instrument of delegation, or a copy of the instrument, for inspection by the person." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Ombudsman may, by written instrument, delegate to an APS employee responsible to the Ombudsman all or any of the Ombudsman’s powers under this Division, other than a power to report to the Minister.   Controlled operations  Part IAB Compliance and monitoring  Division 4  Section 15HY  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) A delegate must, upon request by a person affected by the exercise of any power delegated to the delegate, produce the instrument of delegation, or a copy of the instrument, for inspection by the person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5d4ce036f2bac7a48486bf14eb2049e7f0c3215345519b3dfea06c29a5e004d3" ;
    cof:pageNumber "80"^^xsd:integer ;
