    skos:prefLabel "15JL(2) Integrity testing authorities—cancellation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15jl-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The reasons for cancelling an integrity testing authority under subsection (1) include (but are not limited to) cancellation at the request of the responsible staff member." ;
