    values:originalText "(2) An authority must state the following:  (a) the name of the person granting the authority;  (b) the date of the authority;  (c) details of the assumed identity authorised;  (d) details of any evidence of the assumed identity that may be acquired under the authority;  (e) the conditions (if any) to which the authority is subject;  (f) why the authority is granted;   Part IAC  Assumed Identities" ;
