concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ko a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15KO Indemnity for issuing agencies and officers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15ko ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if the chief officer of either a law enforcement agency or an intelligence agency makes a request under section 15KI or gives a direction under section 15KL to the chief officer of an issuing agency.   Assumed Identities  Part IAC Evidence of Assumed Identity  Division 3  Section 15KO  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) The Commonwealth must indemnify the issuing agency, or an officer of the issuing agency, for any liability incurred by the agency or officer (including reasonable costs) if:  (a) the liability is incurred because of something done by the agency or officer in the course of duty to comply with the request or direction in the course of duty; and  (b) any requirements prescribed under the regulations have been met.   Part IAC  Assumed Identities" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies if the chief officer of either a law enforcement agency or an intelligence agency makes a request under section 15KI or gives a direction under section 15KL to the chief officer of an issuing agency.   Assumed Identities  Part IAC Evidence of Assumed Identity  Division 3  Section 15KO  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) The Commonwealth must indemnify the issuing agency, or an officer of the issuing agency, for any liability incurred by the agency or officer (including reasonable costs) if:  (a) the liability is incurred because of something done by the agency or officer in the course of duty to comply with the request or direction in the course of duty; and  (b) any requirements prescribed under the regulations have been met.   Part IAC  Assumed Identities"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0c2706eb6a68085837738bd562896502e12b855826d34e953ac498e3d2120b07" ;
    cof:pageNumber "122"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ko-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ko-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-act-1914.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.122" .
