concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ko-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15KO(2) Indemnity for issuing agencies and officers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15ko-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Commonwealth must indemnify the issuing agency, or an officer of the issuing agency, for any liability incurred by the agency or officer (including reasonable costs) if:  (a) the liability is incurred because of something done by the agency or officer in the course of duty to comply with the request or direction in the course of duty; and  (b) any requirements prescribed under the regulations have been met.   Part IAC  Assumed Identities" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The Commonwealth must indemnify the issuing agency, or an officer of the issuing agency, for any liability incurred by the agency or officer (including reasonable costs) if:  (a) the liability is incurred because of something done by the agency or officer in the course of duty to comply with the request or direction in the course of duty; and  (b) any requirements prescribed under the regulations have been met.   Part IAC  Assumed Identities"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3c333ba937156289f81eae4b9b0a4225da6d9e5747474ff72f3e21fcc9df6d78" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ko ;
    cof:pageNumber "122"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commonwealth must indemnify issuing agency or officer for liability incurred in course of duty to comply with request or direction." ;
