    cof:title "15KX(1) Requests to a participating jurisdiction for evidence of" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if an authority granted under section 15KB authorises a request under this section." ;
    cof:pageNumber "130"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15kx-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15KX(2) Requests to a participating jurisdiction for evidence of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15kx-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The person specified in subsection (2A) may request the chief officer of an issuing agency of a participating jurisdiction stated in the authority to:  (a) produce evidence of the assumed identity in accordance with the authority; and  (b) give evidence of the assumed identity to the following:  (i) the authorised person named in the authority;  (ii) an officer of the law enforcement agency or the intelligence agency who is named in the request. Note: Section 15KW modifies the effect of this provision if control of the authority is transferred." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The person specified in subsection (2A) may request the chief officer of an issuing agency of a participating jurisdiction stated in the authority to:  (a) produce evidence of the assumed identity in accordance with the authority; and  (b) give evidence of the assumed identity to the following:  (i) the authorised person named in the authority;  (ii) an officer of the law enforcement agency or the intelligence agency who is named in the request. Note: Section 15KW modifies the effect of this provision if control of the authority is transferred."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0fb63c1d72d8712eab37f7ff0ac30e42669726fae438b00a864b3b099c6283b0" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15kx ;
    cof:pageNumber "130"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Request for evidence of assumed identity" ;
