concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15lc-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15LC(3) Disclosing information about assumed identity"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15lc-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) if the person causes the disclosure of information mentioned in paragraph (1)(c), (2)(c) or (3)(c) (as the case may be) and the disclosure is:  (a) in connection with the administration or execution of this Part or a corresponding assumed identity law; or  (b) for the purposes of any legal proceeding arising out of or otherwise related to this Part or a corresponding assumed identity law or of any report of any such proceedings; or   Part IAC  Assumed Identities" ;
    skos:definition "(3) if the person causes the disclosure of information mentioned in paragraph (1)(c), (2)(c) or (3)(c) (as the case may be) and the disclosure is:  (a) in connection with the administration or execution of this Part or a corresponding assumed identity law; or  (b) for the purposes of any legal proceeding arising out of or otherwise related to this Part or a corresponding assumed identity law or of any report of any such proceedings; or   Part IAC  Assumed Identities"@en ;
