concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ma a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15MA Meaning of criminal proceeding"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15ma ;
    values:originalText "(1) In this Part, criminal proceeding means a proceeding for the prosecution, whether summarily or on indictment, of an offence or offences.  (2) To avoid doubt, each of the following is part of a criminal proceeding:  (a) a bail proceeding;   Part IACA  Witness identity protection for operatives" ;
    skos:definition "(1) In this Part, criminal proceeding means a proceeding for the prosecution, whether summarily or on indictment, of an offence or offences.  (2) To avoid doubt, each of the following is part of a criminal proceeding:  (a) a bail proceeding;   Part IACA  Witness identity protection for operatives"@en ;
