    skos:prefLabel "15MG(2) Form of witness identity protection certificate"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15mg-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A witness identity protection certificate for an operative must not contain information that may allow the operative’s identity, or where the operative lives, to be revealed." ;
    skos:definition "(2) A witness identity protection certificate for an operative must not contain information that may allow the operative’s identity, or where the operative lives, to be revealed."@en ;
