concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mi a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15MI Leave for non-compliance"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15mi ;
    values:originalText "(1) The person who has filed, or proposes to file, a witness identity protection certificate may apply to the court for leave not to comply with the requirement under subsection 15MH(2) in relation to the time within which a copy of the certificate is to be given.  (2) However, the court must not give such leave unless it is satisfied that it was not reasonably practicable to comply with the requirement referred to in subsection (1)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The person who has filed, or proposes to file, a witness identity protection certificate may apply to the court for leave not to comply with the requirement under subsection 15MH(2) in relation to the time within which a copy of the certificate is to be given.  (2) However, the court must not give such leave unless it is satisfied that it was not reasonably practicable to comply with the requirement referred to in subsection (1)."@en ;
