concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mj-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15MJ(5) Effect of witness identity protection certificate"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15mj-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) To avoid doubt, subsection (4) does not prevent the taking of a transcript of court proceedings, but the court may make an order for how the transcript is to be dealt with, including an order suppressing its publication." ;
