concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mn-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15MN(2) Application for leave—joinder as respondent"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15mn-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The court in which the application is pending may allow a person to join the application as a respondent if:  (a) the person is:   Witness identity protection for operatives  Part IACA Witness Identity Protection Certificates for Operatives  Division 2  Section 15MO  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (i) the operative in relation to whom the witness identity protection certificate is given; or  (ii) the chief officer of the agency who gave the witness identity protection certificate; and  (b) the person applies to be joined to the application as a respondent; and  (c) the person has sufficient interest in the subject matter of the application." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The court in which the application is pending may allow a person to join the application as a respondent if:  (a) the person is:   Witness identity protection for operatives  Part IACA Witness Identity Protection Certificates for Operatives  Division 2  Section 15MO  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (i) the operative in relation to whom the witness identity protection certificate is given; or  (ii) the chief officer of the agency who gave the witness identity protection certificate; and  (b) the person applies to be joined to the application as a respondent; and  (c) the person has sufficient interest in the subject matter of the application."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "904ab276099a0dc8b7cf106d4d8e35d8fa9e09b8c9bcfccddb4b6cb618925109" ;
