    skos:definition "(1) A defendant in a child proceeding who is not represented by counsel is not to cross-examine a child complainant. Note: A person is not to cross-examine certain persons at committal proceedings or proceedings of a similar kind—see section 15YHA."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4af99c5dbf09c0884efdd4546e032d259a28fe4616c8d41adb7ea7117750b713" ;
