    skos:definition "(1) A defendant in a proceeding who is represented by counsel is not to cross-examine, except through counsel, a person to whom subsection (2) applies. Note: A person is not to cross-examine certain persons at committal proceedings or proceedings of a similar kind—see section 15YHA."@en ;
