doc:sec-15yl-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "15YL(1) Alternative arrangements for giving evidence" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If evidence in a proceeding from a person to whom subsection (3) applies is not to be given by means of closed-circuit television (or under Division 2A), the court:  (a) must make arrangements in order to restrict contact (including visual contact) that the person may have with any defendant while giving evidence; and  (b) may make arrangements in order to restrict contact (including visual contact) that the person may have with members of the public while giving evidence." ;
    cof:pageNumber "188"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yl-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15YL(2) Alternative arrangements for giving evidence"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15yl-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The arrangements may include either of the following:  (a) using screens;  (b) planning seating arrangements for people who have an interest in the proceeding, including:  (i) the level at which they are seated; and  (ii) the people in the person’s line of vision. Persons to whom these alternative arrangements apply" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The arrangements may include either of the following:  (a) using screens;  (b) planning seating arrangements for people who have an interest in the proceeding, including:  (i) the level at which they are seated; and  (ii) the people in the person’s line of vision. Persons to whom these alternative arrangements apply"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6cb48ca1855a26d0dc1ca8fd0f3d9a1ae20cfb064ed9e7939ba0b449dcefbe6a" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yl ;
    cof:pageNumber "188"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Alternative arrangements for giving evidence may include planning seating arrangements. Specifies persons subject to this subsection" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
