concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yq a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15YQ Warnings etc. not to be given about vulnerable persons"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15yq ;
    values:originalText "evidence  (1) If there is a jury in a proceeding in which a person to whom subsection (2) applies has given or will give evidence, the judge is not to warn the jury, or suggest to the jury in any way:  (a) that the law regards persons to whom subsection (2) applies as an unreliable class of witness; or   Protecting vulnerable persons  Part IAD Miscellaneous  Division 6  Section 15YR  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (b) that the law requires greater or lesser weight to be given to evidence that is given by closed-circuit television or alternative arrangements under Division 4; or  (c) that the law requires greater or lesser weight to be given to evidence that is given by a video or audio recording under" ;
    skos:definition "evidence  (1) If there is a jury in a proceeding in which a person to whom subsection (2) applies has given or will give evidence, the judge is not to warn the jury, or suggest to the jury in any way:  (a) that the law regards persons to whom subsection (2) applies as an unreliable class of witness; or   Protecting vulnerable persons  Part IAD Miscellaneous  Division 6  Section 15YR  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (b) that the law requires greater or lesser weight to be given to evidence that is given by closed-circuit television or alternative arrangements under Division 4; or  (c) that the law requires greater or lesser weight to be given to evidence that is given by a video or audio recording under"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d044c720baee40034ea344bea189a473877686147e8c42ba953d611d0b4d9254" ;
    cof:pageNumber "196"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Judge must not warn jury about vulnerable persons" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-act-1914.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.196" ;
