    cof:title "15YU(2) Proceedings to which this Part applies" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) This Part also applies to:  (a) any proceedings, including committal proceedings or proceedings of a similar kind, connected with proceedings covered by subsection (1); and  (b) proceedings under the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 in relation to an offence referred to in subsection (1). Timing of proceedings" ;
    cof:pageNumber "202"^^xsd:integer .

