doc:sec-15yw-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "15YW(3) Observers" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If:  (a) a direction or order is in force under section 15YV; and   Part IAE  Video link evidence in proceedings for terrorism and related offences etc.  Section 15YW  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (b) the direction or order specifies a person for the purposes of this section; the court may vary the direction or order so as to substitute another specified person. Who can be an observer" ;
    cof:pageNumber "205"^^xsd:integer .

