concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15YW(7) Observers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15yw-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) If:  (a) a direction or order is in force under section 15YV; and  (b) the direction or order specifies a person for the purposes of this section; the court may:  (c) direct or allow the specified person to give the court a report, in such form and by such time as the court requires, about   Video link evidence in proceedings for terrorism and related offences etc.  Part IAE  Section 15YX  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  what the person observed in relation to the giving of evidence by the witness; and  (d) make such use of the report as the court considers appropriate for the purpose of deciding whether evidence given by the witness under the section 15YV direction or order should be admitted as evidence in the proceeding. Definitions" ;
    skos:definition "(7) If:  (a) a direction or order is in force under section 15YV; and  (b) the direction or order specifies a person for the purposes of this section; the court may:  (c) direct or allow the specified person to give the court a report, in such form and by such time as the court requires, about   Video link evidence in proceedings for terrorism and related offences etc.  Part IAE  Section 15YX  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  what the person observed in relation to the giving of evidence by the witness; and  (d) make such use of the report as the court considers appropriate for the purpose of deciding whether evidence given by the witness under the section 15YV direction or order should be admitted as evidence in the proceeding. Definitions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a1439418cfbf3b5d3d471cfc40f4098defa5d2846b001d46db81737024ae7c3e" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw ;
    cof:pageNumber "205"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Court may direct or allow specified person to provide report about video link evidence." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-act-1914.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.205" ;
