    cof:title "15YZ(3) Direction to jury" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If:  (a) a court refuses to give a section 15YV direction or refuses to make a section 15YV order; and  (b) the prosecutor applied for the direction or order; the prosecutor may appeal against the refusal." ;
    cof:pageNumber "209"^^xsd:integer .

