    cof:title "16AB(7) Matters relating to victim impact statements" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) For the purposes of Part IAD (about protecting vulnerable persons):  (a) giving evidence includes giving a reading under subsection (4); and  (b) a cross-examination includes a cross-examination under subsection (6). Note: This confirms that any protections available under Part IAD will be available for the reading or the cross-examination." ;
