    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "to be served  In sentencing a person convicted of a federal offence, a court must have regard to:  (a) any sentence already imposed on the person by the court or another court for any other federal offence or for any State or Territory offence, being a sentence that the person has not served; and  (b) any sentence that the person is liable to serve because of the revocation of a parole order made, or licence granted, under this Part or under a law of a State or Territory." ;
    cof:pageNumber "233"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ba a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16BA Taking other offences into account"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-16ba ;
    values:originalText "(1) Where a person is convicted of a federal offence or federal offences, and the court before which the person is convicted is satisfied that:  (a) there has been filed in the court a document in, or to the effect of, the form prescribed for the purposes of this section;  (b) the document contains a list of other federal offences, or offences against the law of an external Territory that is prescribed for the purposes of this section, which the person convicted is believed to have committed;" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Where a person is convicted of a federal offence or federal offences, and the court before which the person is convicted is satisfied that:  (a) there has been filed in the court a document in, or to the effect of, the form prescribed for the purposes of this section;  (b) the document contains a list of other federal offences, or offences against the law of an external Territory that is prescribed for the purposes of this section, which the person convicted is believed to have committed;"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8d9cc7def540f9715301dcfa5c172bff43f5bfc6c1dd119a8cf448383969cd50" ;
    cof:pageNumber "233"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Requires filing of document with list of other federal offences." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
