    cml:logicSummary "Obligation to consider previous custody period." ;
    cml:premiseText "(3) Where the law of a State or Territory does not have the effect mentioned in subsection (2)," ;
    cml:conclusionText "a court (including a federal court) in that State or Territory that imposes a federal sentence on a person or fixes a non-parole period in respect of such a sentence must take into account any period that the person has spent in custody in relation to the offence concerned." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::logic::deontic" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .

