concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19ah a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19AH Failure to fix non-parole period or make recognizance release"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-19ah ;
    values:originalText "order  (1) Where a court fails to fix, or properly to fix, a non-parole period, or to make, or properly to make, a recognizance release order, under this Act:  (a) that failure does not affect the validity of any sentence imposed on a person; and" ;
    skos:definition "order  (1) Where a court fails to fix, or properly to fix, a non-parole period, or to make, or properly to make, a recognizance release order, under this Act:  (a) that failure does not affect the validity of any sentence imposed on a person; and"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9a2491bacbbb0f53d31b738f82a5cde3ccd37dce9c7f02a8e95d102fbde96edd" ;
