    cml:logicSummary "Release on parole is a necessary condition for parole release" ;
    cml:premiseText "(2) However, if the person is imprisoned for a State or Territory offence on the day he or she would otherwise be eligible for release..." ;
    cml:conclusionText "...the person must be released from prison on parole in accordance with the parole order..." ;
