doc:sec-19av-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "19AV(3) Arrest of person whose parole order or licence revoked by" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The prescribed authority is not required to fix a non-parole period under paragraph (1)(f) if:  (a) the prescribed authority considers it inappropriate to do so because of the serious nature of the breach of the conditions of the order or licence that led to its revocation; or  (b) the unserved part of the outstanding sentence or sentences is, or aggregates, 3 months or less." ;
