concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19AV(4) Arrest of person whose parole order or licence revoked by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-19av-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Where a prescribed authority issues a warrant, the prescribed authority must specify in the warrant the particulars of the unserved part of each outstanding sentence and, if a non-parole period is fixed, particulars of that period." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Where a prescribed authority issues a warrant, the prescribed authority must specify in the warrant the particulars of the unserved part of each outstanding sentence and, if a non-parole period is fixed, particulars of that period."@en ;
