    skos:prefLabel "19AZ(3) Evidence before prescribed authority"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-19az-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A summons under this section shall be served in the same manner as a summons to a witness to appear before a court of summary jurisdiction in the State or Territory where the summons under this section is issued. 19AZA  Disobedience of summons etc." ;
    skos:definition "(3) A summons under this section shall be served in the same manner as a summons to a witness to appear before a court of summary jurisdiction in the State or Territory where the summons under this section is issued. 19AZA  Disobedience of summons etc."@en ;
