doc:sec-20ac-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20AC(5) Failure to comply with sentence passed, or order made, under" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) Where a person is apprehended in pursuance of a warrant issued under subsection (2) or (3) and the court before which he or she is to be brought is not sitting at the time of his or her arrest, the person shall be brought before a magistrate, who may:  (a) admit the person to bail, on such recognizance (with or without sureties) as the magistrate thinks fit, on the condition that the person appears, on such date, at such time and at such place as the magistrate specifies, before that court; or  (b) direct that the person be kept in custody in accordance with the warrant." ;
