doc:sec-20bf-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20BF(3) Release order may be revoked" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Where a release order in relation to a person is revoked:  (a) a constable may arrest the person without warrant; or  (b) the Attorney-General or the Director of Public Prosecutions may apply to a prescribed authority for a warrant for the arrest of the person." ;
