concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20bf-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20BF(4) Release order may be revoked"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-20bf-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A person who is arrested under subsection (3) must, as soon as practicable after that arrest, be brought before a prescribed authority in the State or Territory in which the person is arrested.   Sentencing, imprisonment and release of federal offenders  Part IB Unfitness to be tried  Division 6  Section 20BF  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(4) A person who is arrested under subsection (3) must, as soon as practicable after that arrest, be brought before a prescribed authority in the State or Territory in which the person is arrested.   Sentencing, imprisonment and release of federal offenders  Part IB Unfitness to be tried  Division 6  Section 20BF  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
