concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20bf-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20BF(8) Release order may be revoked"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-20bf-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) Where for urgent medical or security reasons it becomes necessary to do so, an officer of the State or Territory in which a person is detained may vary the prison or hospital at which the person is detained but, where the officer does so, the officer must forthwith notify the Attorney-General, in writing, of the variation and of the reasons for that variation." ;
    skos:definition "(8) Where for urgent medical or security reasons it becomes necessary to do so, an officer of the State or Territory in which a person is detained may vary the prison or hospital at which the person is detained but, where the officer does so, the officer must forthwith notify the Attorney-General, in writing, of the variation and of the reasons for that variation."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6dcc3698d0df9f9eab771f95be9306ac1c5c903194e1cb1f3095ab179b335742" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20bf ;
    cof:pageNumber "308"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Notify Attorney-General of variation in detention facility" ;
    dc:description "Reasons for variation" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
