concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20bl-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20BL(3) Attorney-General may order release"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-20bl-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) An order:  (a) must be in writing; and  (b) remains in force for such a period as is specified in the order (being a period equal to the balance of the period fixed by the court for detention in safe custody under subsection 20BJ(1)) or for a period of 5 years, whichever is the lesser; and  (c) is subject to such conditions (if any) as are specified in the order." ;
