concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23 Outline of this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This Part:  (a) provides for the detention of people arrested for Commonwealth offences (see Division 2); and  (b) imposes obligations on investigating officials in relation to:  (i) people arrested for Commonwealth offences; and  (ii) certain other people who are being investigated for Commonwealth offences;  (see Division 3).  (2) To avoid doubt, this Part does not confer any power to arrest a person.  (3) To avoid doubt, only a person arrested for a Commonwealth offence may be detained under this Part." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This Part:  (a) provides for the detention of people arrested for Commonwealth offences (see Division 2); and  (b) imposes obligations on investigating officials in relation to:  (i) people arrested for Commonwealth offences; and  (ii) certain other people who are being investigated for Commonwealth offences;  (see Division 3).  (2) To avoid doubt, this Part does not confer any power to arrest a person.  (3) To avoid doubt, only a person arrested for a Commonwealth offence may be detained under this Part."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2b761d29b3919bc4b69966dbf3c29b11b09b828bcb75e5f0c1fc1c927b3b2aeb" ;
    cof:pageNumber "339"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23-ss-3 ;
