concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23C(3) Period of investigation if arrested for a non-terrorism offence"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23c-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the person is not released within the investigation period, the person must be brought before a bail authority within the investigation period or, if it is not practicable to do so within the investigation period, as soon as practicable after the end of the investigation period." ;
    skos:definition "(3) If the person is not released within the investigation period, the person must be brought before a bail authority within the investigation period or, if it is not practicable to do so within the investigation period, as soon as practicable after the end of the investigation period."@en ;
