    values:originalText "(4) Subsection (3) does not require any information to be included in the instrument if disclosure of that information is likely:  (a) to prejudice national security (within the meaning of the National Security Information (Criminal and Civil Proceedings) Act 2004); or  (b) to be protected by public interest immunity; or  (c) to put at risk ongoing operations by law enforcement agencies or intelligence agencies; or  (d) to put at risk the safety of the community, law enforcement officers or intelligence officers." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Subsection (3) does not require any information to be included in the instrument if disclosure of that information is likely:  (a) to prejudice national security (within the meaning of the National Security Information (Criminal and Civil Proceedings) Act 2004); or  (b) to be protected by public interest immunity; or  (c) to put at risk ongoing operations by law enforcement agencies or intelligence agencies; or  (d) to put at risk the safety of the community, law enforcement officers or intelligence officers."@en ;
