    cof:title "23E(3) Evidentiary provisions if application made by electronic means" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the form of the instrument completed by the investigating official does not, in all material respects, accord with the terms of the instrument signed by the magistrate, the instrument is taken to have had no effect." ;
    cof:pageNumber "363"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23f a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23F Cautioning persons who are under arrest or protected suspects"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23f ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subject to subsection (3), if a person is under arrest or a protected suspect, an investigating official must, before starting to question the person, caution the person that he or she does not have to say or do anything, but that anything the person does say or do may be used in evidence.  (2) The investigating official must inform the person of the caution in accordance with subsection (1), but need only do so in writing if that is the most appropriate means of informing the person.  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) do not apply so far as another law of the Commonwealth requires the person to answer questions put by, or do things required by, the investigating official." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Subject to subsection (3), if a person is under arrest or a protected suspect, an investigating official must, before starting to question the person, caution the person that he or she does not have to say or do anything, but that anything the person does say or do may be used in evidence.  (2) The investigating official must inform the person of the caution in accordance with subsection (1), but need only do so in writing if that is the most appropriate means of informing the person.  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) do not apply so far as another law of the Commonwealth requires the person to answer questions put by, or do things required by, the investigating official."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "eec88c8292d1938a2642a1c61cc98e6ee5fda8a113f0d4b466c2cb7c974a5717" ;
    cof:pageNumber "365"^^xsd:integer ;
