doc:sec-23h-ss-1a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "23H(1A) Aboriginal persons and Torres Strait Islanders" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1A) To avoid doubt, the obligations imposed by subsection (1) do not limit and are not limited by any other obligations imposed, or rights conferred, by this section.  (1AB) If a representative of an Aboriginal legal assistance organisation is notified under subsection (1), the investigating official must not question the person until the earlier of the following times:  (a) the representative has communicated with the person;  (b) 2 hours have elapsed since the representative was notified." ;
    cof:pageNumber "366"^^xsd:integer .

