doc:sec-23l-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "23L(3) Exceptions" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the application of subsection (1) is so authorised:  (a) the record of the investigating official’s grounds for belief must be made as soon as practicable; and  (b) the investigating official must comply with the requirement as soon as possible after subsection (1) ceases to apply." ;
    cof:pageNumber "370"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23l-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23L(4) Exceptions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23l-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the application of subsection (1) results in:  (a) preventing or delaying the person from communicating with a legal practitioner of his or her choice; or  (b) preventing or delaying a legal practitioner of the person’s choice from attending at any questioning; the investigating official must offer the services of another legal practitioner and, if the person accepts, make the necessary arrangements." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If the application of subsection (1) results in:  (a) preventing or delaying the person from communicating with a legal practitioner of his or her choice; or  (b) preventing or delaying a legal practitioner of the person’s choice from attending at any questioning; the investigating official must offer the services of another legal practitioner and, if the person accepts, make the necessary arrangements."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "41ad4005a6934094c2c1890c044ffa9059e8ad221b4c09786683c0abdcc986a3" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23l ;
    cof:pageNumber "370"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Offer services of another legal practitioner if communication or attendance is delayed." ;
    dc:description "Services of another legal practitioner" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
